    "question": "<p>$(AB)_{16}$ এর সমতুল্য —</p><p><br/>i. $(10101011)_{2}$</p><p><br/>ii. $(253)_{8}$</p><p><br/>iii. $(73)_{10}$</p><p><br></p><p>নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?</p>",
    "options": [
      "i ও ii",
      "ii ও iii",
