    ],
    "answer": "i ও ii",
    "explanation": "<p>(AB)<sub>16</sub> = (?)<sub>2</sub></p><p>(AB)<sub>16 </sub>= $\\underset{A}{1010}$    $\\underset{B}{1011}$   =   10101011</p><p>(AB)<sub>16</sub> (10101011)<sub>2</sub></p><p>(AB)<sub>16</sub> = (?)<sub>8</sub></p><p>(AB)<sub>16</sub>= $\\underset{A}{1010}$     $\\underset{B}{1011}$   =   $\\underset{2}{010}$   $\\underset{5}{101}$   $\\underset{3}{011}$   =  253</p><p>$\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\therefore(\\mathrm{AB})_{16}=(253)_8 \\\\ &amp; (\\mathrm{AB})_{16}=(?)_2 \\\\ &amp; (\\mathrm{AB})_{16}=\\mathrm{A} \\times 16^1+\\mathrm{B} \\times 16^0 \\\\ &amp; =10 \\times 16+11 \\times 1=160+11=171 \\\\ &amp; \\therefore(\\mathrm{AB})_{16}=(171)_{10}\\end{aligned}$</p><p>অর্থাৎ সঠিক উত্তর (i), (ii)</p>"
  },
